<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy"
  updated="December 18, 2025"
  description="BubbleNest's privacy policy: what we collect, what we deliberately don't (location, email), ephemeral photos, and full deletion."
  eyebrow="BubbleNest · Legal"
  backHref="/bubblenest"
  backLabel="← Back to BubbleNest"
>
  <p><strong>At a glance:</strong> we don't store your location (checked on-device only), we don't store your email (Google Sign-In provides it, we don't keep it), photos are ephemeral, deleting your account retains nothing, and BubbleNest is strictly 18+.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as your name, age, gender, interests, and preferences etc. We do not collect or store your location. We process your location on your device to confirm you are in a location where our services are offered but we do not send your location to our server. After this point your location is neither used nor stored in our servers. We do not collect or store email addresses. By default Google Sign In provides us your email ID but we do not store it. The location information provided by the user in profile section is not verified but is stored in our servers. For events functionality, we collect and store your event preferences including liked events, events you have tickets for, and your attendance status for events. Any change to how we store your information shall be communicated upon change and your continued use of the service will constitute acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use your information to: (a) provide and improve our matching services; (b) personalize your experience; (c) facilitate connections with other users; (d) send you notifications and updates by storing unique device identifiers; (e) ensure safety and security; (f) analyze usage patterns to improve our service; (g) show you relevant event recommendations based on your interests; (h) facilitate connections with other attendees of events you're interested in.</p>

  <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share your profile information with other users as part of our matching service. For events functionality, when you indicate interest in an event or mark that you have tickets, your profile may be visible to other users interested in the same event to facilitate connections. We do not sell your personal information to third parties. We may share anonymized, aggregated data for analytics purposes. We may share information if required by law or to protect our users' safety.</p>

  <h2>4. Events and Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>Event information displayed in our app is sourced from third-party ticketing platforms. We do not store event images or detailed event information on our servers. When you book tickets, you will be redirected to third-party ticketing websites, and their privacy policies will apply. We only store your event preferences (likes, ticket status, attendance) on our servers to enhance your experience and facilitate connections with other attendees.</p>

  <h2>5. Location Information</h2>
  <p>With your permission on our app's first launch after each install, we process your location on your device to confirm you are in a location where our services are offered but we do not send your location to our server. After this point your location is neither used nor stored in our servers. In case this storage policy is to change, we will notify you and seek your consent before storing any location data. You can control location sharing permissions through your device settings.</p>

  <h2>6. Photos and Content</h2>
  <p>Photos you upload are temporarily processed for display to other users as part of your profile. Our system uses ephemeral storage, meaning photos are not permanently stored on our servers. You have full control over your photos and can update them at any time through the app. Upon logout your photos are deleted from your accounts and are deleted from our servers within 24 hours. We do not retain any photos after account deletion.</p>

  <h2>7. Push Notifications</h2>
  <p>We may send you push notifications about matches, messages, events, and app updates. You can control notification preferences through your device settings or within the app.</p>

  <h2>8. Data Security</h2>
  <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>9. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>Our app may integrate with third-party services like Google Sign-In for authentication and third-party ticketing platforms for event information. These services have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them. We are not responsible for third-party privacy practices.</p>

  <h2>10. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain your personal information as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. Photos are stored ephemerally and are not permanently retained. Event preferences are stored as long as your account is active. When you delete your account, NO DATA IS RETAINED - we completely delete all your personal information. You can delete your account in-app or at <a href="/bubblenest/delete-account">krylabs.com/bubblenest/delete-account</a>.</p>

  <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>BubbleNest is not intended for users under 18 years old. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If we become aware of such collection, we will delete the information immediately. See our <a href="/bubblenest/child-safety">Child Safety Standards</a>.</p>

  <h2>12. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
  <p>You can: (a) access and update your profile information; (b) delete your account and personal information; (c) control notification settings; (d) manage location sharing permissions; (e) manage your event preferences and attendance status; (f) contact us with privacy concerns or requests.</p>

  <h2>13. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes through the app or via push notifications. Your continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

  <h2>14. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us through the app's support feature or at our official support channels. We are committed to addressing your privacy concerns promptly.</p>
</Legal>
